        {
          "id": 544964596,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I am not at ease at all with using \"volatile\" keyword, but:\n* the same pattern is already used for similar variables\n* without it, I got a warning about \"clobbered\" variable\n```\n../tshark.c: In function ‘main’:\n../tshark.c:761:24: error: variable ‘dfilter’ might be clobbered by ‘longjmp’ or ‘vfork’ [-Werror=clobbered]\n  761 |   gchar               *dfilter = NULL;\n      |                        ^~~~~~~\n../tshark.c:2028:19: error: variable ‘exp_pdu_filter’ might be clobbered by ‘longjmp’ or ‘vfork’ [-Werror=clobbered]\n 2028 |       const char *exp_pdu_filter = dfilter; /* may be NULL to disable filter */\n      |                   ^~~~~~~~~~~~~~\ncc1: all warnings being treated as errors\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6875072,
            "username": "IvanNardi",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Ivan Nardi",
            "state": "active",
